(a)
Applied Chemistry;
(b)
Applied Geology;
(c)
Applied Geophysics;
(d)
Applied Mathematics;
(e)
Applied Physics;
(f)
Chemical Engineering;
(g)
Civil Engineering;
(h)
Computer Science and Engineering;
(i)
Electrical Engineering;
(j)
Electronics Engineering;
(k)
Environmental Science and Engineering;
(l)
Fuel and Mineral Engineering;
(m)
Humanities and Social Sciences;
(n)
Management Studies;
(o)
